n to minimize the overall tariff costs for Graco.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2018 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2018-10-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Caroline M. Chambers","x":"Pricing continued to offset material price increases this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2018 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2018-10-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"We've got our tempo for our price increases and we do those on an annual basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2018 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2018-10-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"We confirm our full-year outlook of mid to high single-digit organic sales growth on a constant currency basis for the full year 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2018 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2019-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Caroline M. Chambers","x":"Regarding material cost increases and tariffs, we currently project that they will be an incremental $25 million higher in 2019 .","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/29/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2018 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2019-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Caroline M. Chambers","x":"This projection includes the increase in -- increase in tariff rates that could become effective in March.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/29/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2018 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2019-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"No, we'll have to see how Q1 plays out, our price increase rolls in through Q1 and of course, there are some projects that we reported in Q4 that will hold pricing on through Q1, so I'm not too sure about Q1, but we should be in good shape for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/29/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2018 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2019-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"I think it's a higher price increase just because of the tariff impact and cost pressures that we've got.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/29/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2018 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2019-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Caroline M. Chambers","x":"Our purchasing and manufacturing teams have been working hard with our suppliers on a variety of actions to mitigate the effect of tariffs, and we'll continue to pursue cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/29/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q1","e":"ggg","d":"2019-04-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Caroline Chambers","x":"The incremental effect of tariffs and higher material cost for 2019 is now expected to be approximately $21 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/graco-inc-ggg-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q1","e":"ggg","d":"2019-04-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Caroline Chambers","x":"This is in line with earlier projections and after adjusting out the previously planned increase in China tariffs from 10% to 25%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/graco-inc-ggg-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q1","e":"ggg","d":"2019-04-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Caroline Chambers","x":"Our risk price changes went into effect during the first quarter and price realization improved throughout the quarter, particularly in March.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/graco-inc-ggg-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q1","e":"ggg","d":"2019-04-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick McHale","x":"New products have launched and price realization is on track.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/graco-inc-ggg-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q2","e":"ggg","d":"2019-07-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Caroline Chambers","x":"Realized pricing continued to improve in the second quarter and more than offset the effect of higher material cost and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/graco-inc-ggg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q2","e":"ggg","d":"2019-07-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Caroline Chambers","x":"The incremental effect of tariffs and higher material cost for 2019 is now expected to be approximately $25 million, up from $21 million, as U.S. tariff rates increased to 25% in June and further retaliatory tariffs were implemented from imports into China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/graco-inc-ggg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q2","e":"ggg","d":"2019-07-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"As we moved through the quarter, price realization has moved favorable and the incremental margins improved sequentially, with Contractor incremental margins near 40% and overall company incremental margins in the mid-40s.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/graco-inc-ggg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q2","e":"ggg","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"No expectation at this point of looking at any kind of restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/graco-inc-ggg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q2","e":"ggg","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"Generally, we're doing, I'll say, our restructuring and factory consolidation actions on an ongoing basis and not waiting for a fire.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/graco-inc-ggg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Caroline M. Chambers","x":"Realized pricing continues to offset the effective higher material costs and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"…to a lesser extent in general industrial, it was pretty clear that the across product lines, across business units and even within our supply base that the trade war and the slowdown in automotive in China is really putting some strain, I think, on industrial activity across the board over there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"Price realization remains favorable year-to-date.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2019-10-24","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Saree Boroditsky","x":"Just starting on APAC, you lowered the outlook across the board, and I believe you guys were just out there in China in early September.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2020-01-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Caroline M. Chambers","x":"Realized pricing more than offset higher material costs and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/28/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2020-01-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark W. Sheahan","x":"I think that we more than offset the tariff impact and material cost pressures that we had in the factories.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/28/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2020-01-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"Price realization remained favorable for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/28/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2020-01-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark W. Sheahan","x":"And heading into 2020, of course, we will implement our 2020 price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/28/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2019 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2020-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"We're not going to go and make major headcount reductions or change our strategies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/28/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2020 Q1","e":"ggg","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"…anticipating that there is going to be a lot of our competition that's going to be out there looking for cost reduction and headcount reduction and deferring projects, and we're going to move forward, and I'm going to like where we are when we're done better than I'm going to like where they are.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/graco-inc-ggg-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2020 Q1","e":"ggg","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Deane Dray","x":"So maybe just take us through the expectations of where else, if it's not headcount reductions, but you are cutting back on some spending?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/graco-inc-ggg-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GGG 2020 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2020-10-22","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Jeffrey Hammond","x":"I know you were kind of seeing a big slowdown and challenges around some of the trade tariffs and it seems like you're starting to see growth there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2020 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2020-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"Reduced spending on travel, sound discretionary expense management, good factory performance and solid price realization resulted in improved industrial operating earnings for the quarter, despite the lower sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2020 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"…other ways to effectively reach our Industrial customers using social media, using the Internet, using email campaigns, using the web to try to make sure that to the extent that we can we get our message on cost savings projects and quality improvements that they could consider in front of them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2020 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2021-01-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"Price realization, solid factory performance, and good expense management combined with improved sales resulted in strong Industrial operating earnings for the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/26/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2020 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2021-01-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"We generally put through a modest price increase each year and expect to realize somewhere in that 1.5%, maybe up to 2% realized pricing and I don't think this year is going to be really anything different on that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/26/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2020 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2021-01-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"…our outstanding employees, suppliers and distributor partners, we were able to keep our factories and distribution centers fully operational, avoid layoffs and wage reductions, and fully invest in our core long-term growth strategies of new product development, channel expansion and new markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/26/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2020 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2021-01-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"If we see opportunities to buy our stock back at what we think are good prices, and we're going to look for M&A opportunities, we're going to invest back in the business and new product development and automation and other cost reduction projects and the Graco program is going to continue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/26/graco-inc-ggg-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2021 Q1","e":"ggg","d":"2021-04-22","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Deane Dray","x":"And then just in terms of pricing power and one of the things the lessons I learned from Graco back when 2018 when our biggest worry was about tariffs, if you remember that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/graco-inc-ggg-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2021 Q1","e":"ggg","d":"2021-04-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"So I think you could expect that that price realization would be similar to past years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/graco-inc-ggg-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2021 Q1","e":"ggg","d":"2021-04-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. McHale","x":"So you may see price increases on our list-to-list basis higher and different product categories out in the marketplace or you may hear from our channel partners that the numbers are higher, but we run promotions and we do discounts and there's lots of other factors that involve it what the net…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/graco-inc-ggg-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2021 Q2","e":"ggg","d":"2021-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark W. Sheahan","x":"We are realizing price gain, I would say, more or less in line with what we had expected to realize when we put our price increases through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/graco-inc-ggg-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2021 Q2","e":"ggg","d":"2021-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark W. Sheahan","x":"Project business is a little bit different than like our normal price increase, right.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/graco-inc-ggg-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2021 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2021-10-21","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Deane Dray","x":"Just start with a comment on pricing, not a question, is, I think if you just have to replay any of the second half 2018 conference calls when the biggest issue we were dealing with was Chinese tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2021 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2021-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark W. Sheahan","x":"So I think from our standpoint, we feel like we're positioned well to be able to get our price increases across the line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2021 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2021-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark W. Sheahan","x":"I think it's happened in our end markets with some of our competitors where they have raised prices midyear.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2021 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2021-10-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark W. Sheahan","x":"With demand persisting, we confirm our full year outlook of mid- to high-teen organic revenue growth on a constant currency basis for the full year 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/graco-inc-ggg-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2024 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2024-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mike Halloran","x":"At the end of the day, this seems more -- the restructuring you're doing here seems more like a driver for growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/graco-ggg-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q2","e":"ggg","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher D. Knutson","x":"In addition, tariffs increased $4 million in the quarter, resulting in an additional 80 basis point decline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/graco-ggg-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q2","e":"ggg","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher D. Knutson","x":"Price realization was not enough to offset higher product costs resulting from lower factory volume, tariffs and unfavorable channel and product mix in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/graco-ggg-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q2","e":"ggg","d":"2025-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark W. Sheahan","x":"To offset the impact from tariffs, we have announced targeted price increases beginning in September.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/graco-ggg-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q2","e":"ggg","d":"2025-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark W. Sheahan","x":"These pricing actions are focused on key markets and geographies most impacted by tariffs and are in addition to our normal beginning of the year price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/graco-ggg-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2025-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher Knutson","x":"The effects of our targeted interim pricing actions started to be realized during the quarter, offsetting higher product costs resulting from lower factory volume, unfavorable effects of lower margin rates from acquired operations and incremental tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/graco-ggg-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2025-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher Knutson","x":"Tariffs affected product costs by $5 million in the quarter, resulting in a 100 basis point decline in the gross margin rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/graco-ggg-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2025-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Sheahan","x":"We announced targeted price increases during the third quarter, and those efforts are gaining traction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/graco-ggg-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q3","e":"ggg","d":"2025-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Sheahan","x":"We did announce price increases in the early third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/graco-ggg-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2026-01-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Lowe","x":"Certainly, tariffs were a headwind for us that we made a mid-course correction with price adjustments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/graco-ggg-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2026-01-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Sheahan","x":"I think we're pretty well covered on the tariff front.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/graco-ggg-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2026-01-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Sheahan","x":"The timing of some of our larger customers and their price increases is more on a midyear basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/graco-ggg-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2026-01-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jeffrey Hammond","x":"Just back on the home center, as you talk to those customers, did you get the sense of like did inventories get too low, or they're getting ahead of a price increase, or if it's underlying demand is actually getting better?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/graco-ggg-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2026-01-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Sheahan","x":"There's no ongoing restructuring that we're doing costs that we're taking out related to One Graco.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/graco-ggg-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GGG 2025 Q4","e":"ggg","d":"2026-01-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Sheahan","x":"But there's no ongoing cost out happening at the company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/graco-ggg-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/